---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { TeamCarousel } from "@/components/TeamCarousel";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Renegade Capital | AI & The Social Justice Investor"
  description="Aligning capital and artificial intelligence with equity, labor rights, and environmental justice."
>
  <main class="flex flex-1 flex-col">
    <section
      class="relative flex min-h-[90svh] flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-background px-6 py-24 text-center"
    >
      <div
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"
      >
        <div class="h-[600px] w-[600px] rounded-full bg-[#a96c61]/15 blur-3xl">
        </div>
        <div
          class="absolute h-[400px] w-[400px] rounded-full bg-[#bac48c]/15 blur-3xl translate-x-1/3 translate-y-1/3"
        >
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-5xl">
        <span
          class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#a96c61]/30 bg-[#a96c61]/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-[#a96c61] uppercase"
        >
          <span
            class="size-2 rounded-full bg-[#a96c61] animate-pulse"
            aria-hidden="true"></span>
          AI x Social Justice Investing
        </span>

        <img
          src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/682230d9918bf67071aafaab/2a4bdae2-a3d2-4268-88ca-05bada9d11ae/RC_Logo+transparent+%281%29.png"
          alt="Renegade Capital"
          class="mx-auto w-full max-w-xl dark:invert opacity-95 mb-8 drop-shadow-sm"
        />

        <h1
          class="text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
        >
          Wealth shouldn't come at the <br class="hidden lg:block" />
          <span class="text-[#a96c61]">cost of our digital civil rights.</span>
        </h1>

        <p
          class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground sm:text-xl"
        >
          The same capital dismantling systemic inequity in finance must now
          interrogate the algorithms. From <strong class="text-foreground"
            >algorithmic redlining</strong
          > to the <strong class="text-foreground"
            >environmental toll of data centers</strong
          >, we’re bridging the gap between ethical investing and the AI
          frontier.
        </p>

        <div
          class="mt-12 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center"
        >
          <a
            href="#ai-agent"
            class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#a96c61] px-8 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg transition-all hover:bg-[#8b574d] hover:scale-105"
          >
            Talk to the Investor AI
          </a>
          <a
            href="#experts"
            class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border-2 border-[#bac48c] bg-transparent px-8 text-sm font-bold text-[#bac48c] shadow-sm transition-all hover:bg-[#bac48c]/10 hover:scale-105"
          >
            View the Expert Dossier
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section
      id="ai-agent"
      class="bg-muted/30 px-6 py-24 border-y border-border/50"
    >
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <div class="grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2 items-center">
          <div>
            <h2
              class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl"
            >
              Your Personal Social Justice <br /> Investment Strategist
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              We've trained a custom AI on the foundational research of <em
                >The Social Justice Investor</em
              >. It’s designed to provide instant, expert feedback on your
              portfolio, explain complex strategies, and help you identify "Wolf
              in Sheep’s Clothing" investments in seconds.
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div
                  class="mt-1 size-5 rounded-full bg-[#bac48c]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[#bac48c]"
                >
                  ✓
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm text-foreground">
                  <strong>Instant Strategy Feedback:</strong> Chat with a bot that
                  knows your investment goals.
                </p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div
                  class="mt-1 size-5 rounded-full bg-[#bac48c]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[#bac48c]"
                >
                  ✓
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm text-foreground">
                  <strong>Audit for Bias:</strong> Screen potential investments for
                  digital redlining and labor risks.
                </p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div
                  class="mt-1 size-5 rounded-full bg-[#bac48c]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[#bac48c]"
                >
                  ✓
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm text-foreground">
                  <strong>Accessible Expertise:</strong> Whether you have $100 or
                  $100M, the advice is free and fast.
                </p>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div
            class="relative rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-4 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div
              class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl bg-muted flex flex-col p-6 overflow-hidden"
            >
              <div class="space-y-4">
                <div class="flex justify-start">
                  <div
                    class="max-w-[80%] rounded-2xl bg-background border border-border p-3 text-xs"
                  >
                    "I'm considering a fund that uses AI for healthcare
                    diagnostics. Is this a Social Justice win?"
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-end">
                  <div
                    class="max-w-[80%] rounded-2xl bg-[#a96c61] p-3 text-xs text-white"
                  >
                    "According to Dr. Marzyeh Ghassemi's research, many clinical
                    algorithms have data gaps for diverse skin tones. You should
                    ask: 'How was the training data vetted for demographic
                    equity?'"
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-border">
                <div
                  class="h-10 rounded-full bg-background border border-border px-4 flex items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs"
                >
                  Type a question about your portfolio...
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-background px-6 py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <div
          class="rounded-[2.5rem] bg-[#1a1a1a] p-8 md:p-16 text-white overflow-hidden relative"
        >
          <div class="relative z-10 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">
                Defending Humanity <br /> Against "Invisible" Deregulation
              </h2>
              <p class="mt-6 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                New federal directives are attempting to strip consumer
                protections, remove privacy rights, and treat users like guinea
                pigs for corporate AI experiments. This isn't just a tech
                issue—it's an investment risk.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="space-y-2">
                  <h4 class="font-bold text-[#bac48c]">The AI Tax Movement</h4>
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">
                    Supporting AOC and Bernie Sanders' vision to tax companies
                    that replace humans with AI, funding a stronger social
                    safety net.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-2">
                  <h4 class="font-bold text-[#a96c61]">
                    Environmental Justice
                  </h4>
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">
                    Combating the surge in data centers that drive up local
                    utility costs and drain community water resources.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              class="flex flex-col justify-center border-l border-white/10 pl-0 lg:pl-12"
            >
              <blockquote class="text-xl italic font-light text-gray-300">
                "We must demand pro-worker AI—technologies designed to augment
                human labor rather than merely automating it to inflate
                shareholder returns."
              </blockquote>
              <cite class="mt-4 block font-semibold text-[#a96c61]"
                >— Dr. Daron Acemoglu, Nobel Laureate</cite
              >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="experts" class="bg-muted/20 px-6 py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl text-center mb-16">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl"
        >
          The Expert Podcast Dossier
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
          We've curated 6 cohorts of world-class thinkers for the podcast to
          bridge AI and Capital.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div
          class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all hover:border-[#a96c61]/50 shadow-sm"
        >
          <span
            class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#a96c61]"
            >Cohort I</span
          >
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold">Algorithmic Inequity</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            Tackling digital redlining with Dr. Safiya Noble, Dr. Ruha Benjamin,
            and Meredith Broussard.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all hover:border-[#bac48c]/50 shadow-sm"
        >
          <span
            class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#bac48c]"
            >Cohort II</span
          >
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold">Planetary Costs</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            The material reality of AI with Dr. Kate Crawford and Sampriti
            Bhattacharyya.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all hover:border-blue-400 shadow-sm"
        >
          <span
            class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400"
            >Cohort III</span
          >
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold">The Future of Labor</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            Defending worker dignity with Dr. Daron Acemoglu and Ai-jen Poo.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <a
          href="/episodes"
          class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#a96c61] hover:underline"
          >View the full list of 22 experts &rarr;</a
        >
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-background px-6 py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl text-center mb-16">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl"
        >
          Meet the Team
        </h2>
      </div>
      <TeamCarousel client:load />
    </section>

    <section
      class="relative px-6 py-32 overflow-hidden border-t border-border/50"
    >
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#a96c61]/5 via-background to-[#bac48c]/5"
      >
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
          Ready to align your money <br class="hidden sm:block" /> with the future?
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-muted-foreground">
          Join the movement of renegade investors using AI to build a more just,
          inclusive, and sustainable economy.
        </p>
        <div
          class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center"
        >
          <a
            href="/investor"
            class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#a96c61] px-10 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-xl transition-all hover:bg-[#8b574d] hover:scale-105"
          >
            Get Started
          </a>
          <button
            class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-[#a96c61] transition-colors"
          >
            Download the Prospectus
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
